| %sum = add i32 %x, 1 | Yes: an i32. | Consider its uses. |
| store i32 %sum, ptr %slot | No: void result. | Keep the effect; do not demote a nonexistent result. |
| %p = alloca i32 | Yes: a pointer. | Needs the separate storage filter in the next lesson. |

